 "panel_title": "Secure-boot hardware",
 "banner": "Our own boot-check hardware, in several protected versions. Each card asks: how many modelled bit flips make it accept a wrong image? Results are bounded (k flips, fixed cycles) and appear only after a cloud run; until then every result is NOT_RUN.",
